1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,350
I was seven years old
and I saw the white flight

2
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:06,520
control room on a tour
from Space Center Houston

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,720
and that just sparked
everything for me.

4
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:12,310
So follow your passions,
follow your dreams,

5
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:14,080
and they can lead to you
somewhere amazing.

6
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:17,510
I just flew a a spaceship
around the moon from that

7
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:18,790
very flight control room

8
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:20,370
that I saw as a little girl.
